                            2
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَصَّلَهُ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْصِيلٌ</span>, <i>He joined,</i> or <i>connected, much: he made</i> a string <i>to have many
joinings.</i> (TA: the latter from an explanation
of the pass. part. n.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَصَّلَهُ إِلَيْهِ</span>
                        <i>He made it
to reach it,</i> or <i>him:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْهَاهُ إِلَيْهِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْلَفَهُ</span>
                        
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيَّاه</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَيْهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْصَلَهُ</span></b>  [q. v.]. (TA.) See an
ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غفَلَ</span>.

